    seom:involvedEmployers """AGCO Ltd, Agricultural Engineers Association (AEA), B & B Tractors Ltd, British Agricultural and Garden Machinery Association (BAGMA), Case New Holland, CLAAS UK Ltd, Ernest Doe & Sons Ltd, Grimme UK Ltd, Institute of Agricultural Engineers (IAgrE), John Deere, Makita UK Ltd, Russell's Agriculture, T H White Ltd. 
Other organisations involved: IMI, LANTRA, Myerscough College, ProVQ Ltd, Reaseheath College.""" ;
