<https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/occupation/OCC0296> a seom:Occupation ;
    rdfs:label "Papermaker" ;
    dct:description "The Papermaker operates machinery both individually, or as part of a team, to convert raw materials to paper products in an operator or assistant role in the process for Pulping, Drying, Reeling, Coating, basic Maintenance and Quality Control Testing. Working with minimum supervision the Papermaker has knowledge of the entire process." ;
