        <https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/green-theme/4> ;
    seom:inPathway <https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/pathway/66> ;
    seom:inRoute <https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/route/8> ;
    seom:involvedEmployers "Rolls Royce, The British Institute of NDT, RWE Generation UK plc, Ultramag Inspection, Applus RTD UK Ltd, Johnson & Allen RSA GB Inspection Services, NDT Allianz Engineering, Serco, Rail Technical NFW Co TWI, Tata Steel Speciality Steels, NuGen, James Fisher EON/Uniper, Lavender International, TWI (north), Rolls-Royce PLC, Royal Sun Alliance, Npower, E.ON Technologies, Intertek Services Sellafield National Skills Academy for Nuclear, NDE Research Association, Airbus, AMEC, BAE Systems, BP, EDF (Nuclear), Dstl, GKN, Hitachi, Nat Nuclear Labs, Office Regulation, Petrobras, Shell, SKF, Tenaris, Oceaneering UK, Trac Oil Gas, Petroplan Resources Steel, Rolls-Royce, Intertek, Amec Foster Wheeler, International Argyll-Ruane, Babcock, Aegleteq Energy, University Northampton, , Semta, Mechanical Engineers" ;
