    seom:involvedEmployers "Walter Smith Fine Foods Ltd, EEF, Remploy, Sainsbury’s, Sanctuary Group, Bakkavor, BT, Canon, YBS Group, Volvo, Specsavers, Severn Trent PLC, Civil Service Learning & Marston’s PLC" ;
