    seom:involvedEmployers "Allianz UK, Bureau Veritas, Zurich, HSB Engineering Insurance Limited, British Engineering Services Ltd, Responsive ltd, Code A Weld Inspection Ltd, Axiom Engineering Associates Ltd, PHS Compliance, SGS" ;
