    dct:description """This occupation is found in all legal firms that deliver conveyancing, and, or probate legal services and advice. Licensed Conveyancer and Probate Practitioners work in a variety of legal teams and settings. They deal with a broad range of professional organisations or persons. These can include accountants, banks, local authorities, tax authorities, trusts, charities and property professionals.
