    seom:inRoute <https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/route/2> ;
    seom:involvedEmployers "HEE Library and Knowledge Services (LKS) North; Barts Health NHS Trust; National Institute for Health and Care Excellence; Libraries unlimited; Lancashire County Council; Jersey Library; Suffolk Libraries; University of the West of England; The Bodleian Libraries; University of East London; University of West London; Barnsley College; British Library; Ripley Lancashire School; Ministry of Defence; Farrer & Co" ;
