    seom:involvedEmployers "Whirlpool UK Appliances Limited, Samsung, BSH Home Appliances Ltd, Fisher Paykel R.S.L, Genserve, H&H Video & TV, DBS York Ltd, Know How, Borshch, Electrolux PLC, Service-Line, Chapmans Electrical" ;
