        "scientific procedures",
        "scientific research",
        "scientific testing",
        "technical procedures" ;
    seom:level 4 ;
    seom:overview "Working in hospitals, primary care and other healthcare settings, carrying out routine technical and scientific procedures. Supporting healthcare science (HCS) practitioners and clinical scientists." ;
    seom:progressesTo <https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/occupation/OCC0413>,
