        "laboratory",
        "orthodontics" ;
    seom:level 5 ;
    seom:overview "Design, manufacture, modify and repair custom-made dental appliances. Typically the work is undertaken in a dental laboratory on a prescription from a dentist. The work can broadly be split into crown and bridge, dentures and orthodontics." ;
