    seom:involvedEmployers "A&B Joinery, Association of Brickwork Contractors, Barratt Developments PLC, Bordercraft Group, City and Guilds, Dunchurch Brickwork, Fairgrove Homes, Federation of Master Builders, FMB, Galliard Homes, George Cook, Home Builders Federation, Lyons & Annoot Ltd, McCarthy and Stone, Morgan Sindall Group (Lovell Homes), Redrow, Saint Gobain, Taylor Wimpey, William Davis" ;
