<https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/occupation/OCC0268> a seom:Occupation ;
    rdfs:label "Piling attendant" ;
    dct:description "Jobholders in this role assist in driving, boring and forming piles in the ground in order to provide firm support for buildings and structures by attending to the requirements of the piling operation. The work includes supporting piling plant machine operatives and specialist piling operatives (Level 3) by performing a variety of manual and mechanically assisted tasks which will include; load and unload, handle and move materials, prepare, measure, mark and cut materials, monitoring and reporting progress. Guide and control the movement and operation of plant, machinery and vehicles. Prepare, check, control and maintain machinery and equipment in use. Recover, clean, and maintain equipment for reuse." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Piling attendant" ;
    seom:atTechnicalLevel <https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/technical-level/1> ;
