    seom:involvedEmployers "Direct Works Forum, Futures Housing, RFT Services / Flagship Homes, Bernicia Homes, Flagship Services, Tesco, Mears Group, Berneslai Homes, Chartered Association of Building Engineers (CABE), Institute of Workplace and Facilities Management (IWFM), Wrekin Housing Trust, Hyde Housing, Riverside, Nottingham City Homes" ;
