<https://gov.tesseract.academy/id/seom/occupation/OCC0481> a seom:Occupation ;
    rdfs:label "Digital marketer" ;
    dct:description "The Digital Marketer will lead on the creation and execution of a digital marketing strategy. They recognise and respond to business opportunities and customer requirements through a range of digital channels (such as Social Media, Websites, email). They actively employ content marketing and campaign management principles, and financial and analytical tools, to deliver successful initiatives that meet the needs and aspirations of their organisation." ;
